r me the bottom line most successful  entrepreneurs you'll find started  because I really love what they're doing  they feel like they have been a really  strong impact and they love the prompt  service that they're selling it's really  hard to get excited about a product if  you don't really believe in what it does  or if you're not and  avid user yourself if you mean it just  for the money because you think you can  make great commissions you're probably  not going to be really successful the  successful people come when they are  super passionate and are using a product  or service and really believe in it that  makes it easy to sell then you're not  really selling you just share your  experiences and your passion comes  through because they can see that you're  using it and you're really excited about  it so this product that you mentioned to  me you know are you using it you find it  valuable have you implemented it into  your own life and can you share personal  experiences about it or not you know if  no I would probably say no through the  opportunity and maybe look for something  else it could still be with the network  marketing but make sure that you are  passionate about that product that you  end up selling so hopefully that helps  good luck let me know if you end up you  know taking that opportunity or not for  those watching if you liked the video  please give it a thumbs up but love  seeing those come in and if you have any  thoughts reviews as well be great to  hear what you have to say associate you  had some experience in network marketing  please leave a comment below and we'll  see you on the next episode  you  you
 

